   {
    "titulo": "Integrar sobre V(t) y aplicar Gauss",
    "ecuacion": "\\int_{V(t)}\\frac{\\partial(\\rho e)}{\\partial t}\\,dV=-\\oint_{\\partial V(t)}\\rho e(\\mathbf v)\\cdot\\mathbf n\\,dA-\\oint_{\\partial V(t)}\\mathbf q\\cdot\\mathbf n\\,dA+\\oint_{\\partial V(t)}(\\boldsymbol\\sigma\\cdot\\mathbf v)\\cdot\\mathbf n\\,dA+\\int_{V(t)}\\rho\\mathbf b\\cdot\\mathbf v\\,dV+\\int_{V(t)}r_v\\,dV",
